ed to the three months ended June 30, 2025. This increase was primarily due to increases of $0.3 million in the cost of materials and supplies, $0.2 million in depreciation and amortization, $0.2 million in employee-related expenses (including salaries, benefits and stock-based compensation), and $0.3 million in other expenses, partially offset by a decrease of $0.1 million in royalty expenses.","context":"Cost of Revenue","section":"Results of Operations","block":324,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001274737-26-000048","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-04","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001274737","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1274737/000127473726000048/exdx-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d9fadf934cc3f0d633ee430a9384647a9e7476a4220b23939bf73242ed8ef427.bin","sha256":"d9fadf934cc3f0d633ee430a9384647a9e7476a4220b23939bf73242ed8ef427"}},{"id":"df21cdf67d8019b6bcf49ba6e4aab2ea01df818115efb199a3fbaf53277917df","quote":"Gross margin as a percentage of revenue increased to 61.3% for the three months ended June 30, 2026 compared to 60.4% for the three months ended June 30, 2025, primarily due to the changes to revenue and cost of revenue described above.","context":"Gross Margin","section":"Results of Operations","block":326,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001274737-26-000048","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-04","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001274737","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1274737/000127473726000048/exdx-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d9fadf934cc3f0d633ee430a9384647a9e7476a4220b23939bf73242ed8ef427.bin","sha256":"d9fadf934cc3f0d633ee430a9384647a9e7476a4220b23939bf73242ed8ef427"}},{"id":"a08a288d1d25963e52554c9f38c4305a70ec1f47aa3ecd4edd74e09ee953eed3","quote":"Selling, general and administrative expenses increased $1.0 million, or 8.4%, 