 Lease shall be cancelled or terminated or shall expire or shall be reduced or materially changed, except, in each case, as permitted in this Lease, or mutually agreed to in writing by the parties; (vii) if Tenant shall fail to immediately discharge or bond over any lien placed upon the Premises in violation of this Lease; (viii) if any Letter of Credit required to be maintained by Tenant pursuant to this Lease shall be cancelled or terminated or shall expire or shall be reduced or materially changed, except, in each","context":"22.DEFAULT; REMEDIES.","section":"","block":88,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001274737-26-000048","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-04","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001274737","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1274737/000127473726000048/exagen-2175salkavelease.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/45404b9dfc3029ab8ee3cf6f849441ef224f9b9ce844321e14b2760c83e774ed.bin","sha256":"45404b9dfc3029ab8ee3cf6f849441ef224f9b9ce844321e14b2760c83e774ed"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"riskFactors":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"segmentIntelligence":{"status":"evidence_available","evidence":[{"id":"1816c1a282a56b00d7df12f1a830d28482f8bb2545f495535f1fd99ffd4e66a9","quote":"(G) Tenant shall require all contractors and subcontractors used by Tenant for work or other activities on or about the Premises to meet the insurance requirements set forth in Sections 9(A)(i), (ii), and (iii).","context":"(F) Landlord my, at is sole discretion, change the insurance policy limits and forms which are required to be provided by Tenant; such changes will be made to conform with common insurance requirements for similar properties in similar geographic locations.","section":"","block":52,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001274737-26-000048","